#: app/capture_plans.py:479
msgid ""
"Only the booking's holder, the telescope's owner or an admin can start a "
"plan"
msgstr ""
"Solo el titular de la reserva, el propietario del telescopio o un "
"administrador pueden iniciar un plan"

#: app/capture_plans.py:484
msgid "You need a booking that covers now to start a plan"
msgstr "Necesitas una reserva vigente en este momento para iniciar un plan"

